{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "11afa4a0-e566-88c3-a770-00e8b1265400",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T12:20:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about a pothole. I'm on speaker, I've got my hands full, so can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 26 Old Beach Road. Right in front of the house, in the travel lane. [pause] It got a lot worse after last weekend's nor'easter, the Saturday into Sunday one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 26 Old Beach Road, pothole in the travel lane, worse since the storm. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's deep enough to swallow a tire. I'm not exaggerating. I watched a car drop into it this morning and the whole front end bounced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ooh, yeah, that'll do damage. Got it, I'm writing that down. Is that street a through road, like traffic goes by a lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the bus route. The school bus and the regular bus both come down it. As I said before, it's not a side street nobody uses."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, so bus route, deep hole. Have you called about this one before, or is this the first report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First report on this one. I just want the street added to the repair list. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put it in as a request for Old Beach Road, near number 26, and flag the bus route and the depth. Crews are working through a pile of these after the storm, so it'll get slotted in with the rest. Do you want a call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[sigh] Yes, you can reach me at 401-555-0156."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five six, got it. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Diane Barone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Diane. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that I hope they get to it soon. The kids are on that bus, and the only thing worse than that hole would be a snow day landing on a test day. I hope that never comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, I hear you. Well, it's in the system. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
